{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine elemental powers and blast your way through hordes of nightmarish creatures in RealmWalker! In this third-person roguelite ARPG every run brings new magical abilities, challenging enemy encounters and ever shifting realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped in the fractured dimension of Setsara, you must master an evolving arsenal of spells, uncover secrets, and defeat mighty boss entities to reclaim your freedom and restore balance to the realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301490/extras/f60ba5746a2f8b033e6e8ca472232fd6.avif?t=1756479493\" width=1600 height=85 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301490/extras/42cd0cd47edb9b252a8a5ff0e0084ebc.poster.avif?t=1756479493\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301490/extras/42cd0cd47edb9b252a8a5ff0e0084ebc.webm?t=1756479493\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301490/extras/42cd0cd47edb9b252a8a5ff0e0084ebc.mp4?t=1756479493\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Combine and enhance a variety of spells, talents, and effects to perfect your creature-slaying build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301490/extras/f41ca2a1e961fccd291cb07442d96dc4.avif?t=1756479493\" width=1600 height=88 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301490/extras/211cc17337211983dd85a997428cb398.p